  "goodToKnow": "Ertönen means to sound or ring out, somewhat literary: Die Glocken ertönen, ein Schrei ertönte, die Nationalhymne ertönt. In Germany, sirens are tested on the nationwide Warntag, when they ertönen at 11 a.m. in many areas, along with cell broadcast alerts on phones. Der Ton means sound or tone, and also clay. With sein: ist ertönt."
